339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 171 0 R
/T (Access to mental health support is a well-documented gap, particularly among students and young professionals. Long waits for professional consultation, social stigma around seeking help, and a general lack of easy, judgment-free tools for everyday emotional self-awareness all contribute to people's wellbeing concerns going unnoticed until they become serious. At the same time, two technologies have matured to the point where they can meaningfully help: real- time facial-expression recognition \(lightweight CNNs that can run on a laptop webcam\) and large language models \(now accessible through pay-per-use APIs rather than requiring a team to train one in-house\).)
/E (Access to mental health support is a well-documented gap, particularly among students and young professionals. Long waits for professional consultation, social stigma around seeking help, and a general lack of easy, judgment-free tools for everyday emotional self-awareness all contribute to people's wellbeing concerns going unnoticed until they become serious. At the same time, two technologies have matured to the point where they can meaningfully help: real- time facial-expression recognition \(lightweight CNNs that can run on a laptop webcam\) and large language models \(now accessible through pay-per-use APIs rather than requiring a team to train one in-house\).)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
