/E (Application layer \(Flask REST API\). Owns all business logic: request validation, password hashing \(werkzeug.security\), session management, CORS enforcement \(restricted to the known frontend origin\), and orchestration of the two backing capabilities below. Every route is also exposed through Flasgger's interactive Swagger documentation.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
